     "construction": "f1a_stokes_check.structured_mesh(N): the N = 8 BASE mesh (8 x 8 squares split along the (1,1) diagonal, except the two cells at the corners (1,0) and (0,1), split the other way: no triangle with all vertices on the boundary) refined uniformly (red) log2(N/8) times. Nested; the flipped region of level N is a (N/8) x (N/8) block at each of those corners. The check module verifies counts, hash and nestedness.",
     "h_definition": "h_nominal = 1/N (leg of the right triangles); h_max = sqrt(2)/N reported too"
    },
    "distorted": {
     "family": "distorted",
     "N0": 4,
     "refinements": [
