      0.125,
      0.0625,
      0.03125,
      0.015625,
      0.0078125
     ],
     "perturb_rel": 0.2,
     "seed": 20261031,
     "rng": "numpy.random.Generator(PCG64(seed)).uniform(-1, 1, (n_interior, 2))",
     "construction": "f1a_stokes_check.distorted_mesh(k): structured N0 = 4 base mesh (corner cells flipped); every INTERIOR vertex displaced by perturb_rel * (1/N0) * U(-1,1)^2 (boundary vertices fixed); then k uniform red refinements (nested; element sizes and Jacobians vary from element to element at every level).",
     "h_definition": "h_nominal = 0.25 / 2^k (base nominal size halved per red refinement); h_max reported"
    }
   },
   "boundaries": {
    "x0": "dirichlet",
    "y0": "dirichlet",
    "x1": "traction g = sigma_form n",
    "y1": "traction g = sigma_form n"
   },
   "pressure": "determined (no nullspace); no pressure constraint passed",
   "shared_node_rule": "At a velocity node shared by several boundary attributes: (1) Dirichlet beats every natural condition (traction, do-nothing) and every slip/symmetry constraint (the slip constraint is not imposed at such nodes); (2) between Dirichlet attributes the fixed data AGREE at shared nodes (checked: dirichlet_shared_node_mismatch_max), so no precedence between them is needed and the result is independent of attribute order; (3) between two slip/symmetry attributes both normal constraints are imposed (u = 0 at a convex corner); (4) a periodic pair at a Dirichlet corner takes the (periodic-consistent) Dirichlet value."
  }
